---
title: Lamb Köfte with Yogurt Sauce and Muhammara
servings: 6
source: https://www.bonappetit.com/recipe/lamb-k-fte-with-yogurt-sauce-and-muhammara
tags: Lamb
---

= Yogurt Sauce =
In a medium bowl, mix the @plain yogurt{1%cup}(low-fat), @tahini{2%tbsp}(sesame seed paste),
@lemon juice{1%tbsp}, and @salt{1/2%teaspoon}.
Cover and chill.

= Köfte =
Line a large rimmed #baking sheet{} with foil.
Gently mix @ground lamb{2%lb}, @fresh mint{1/2%cup}(minced), @onion{1/4%cup}(coarse grated),
@garlic{4%cloves}(minced), @paprika{3%tbsp}, @ground cumin{1%tbsp}, @kosher salt{1 1/2%tsp},
@black pepper{1%tsp}, and @cayenne pepper{1/2%tsp} in a #large bowl{}.

Using moistened hands and scant 2 tablespoonfuls for each, roll meat mixture into 1 1/2-inch meatballs. Arrange on sheet.

Preheat oven to 300°F.
Place large sheet of foil on work surface.
Heat large nonstick or cast-iron skillet over medium-high heat.
Add @flatbreads or pitas{12}(preferably with no pocket) to skillet 1 at a time;
cook until browned, about ~{2%minutes} per side.
Enclose in foil; place in oven to keep warm.

Heat @olive oil{1%tbsp} in same skillet over medium-high heat.
Add @large onions{2}(halved and sliced thick); sprinkle lightly with @salt and @pepper.
Sauté until golden brown, about ~{8%minutes}.
Transfer onions to 1 side of large rimmed baking sheet; place in oven to keep warm.

Add @olive oil{1%tbsp} to same skillet; heat over medium-high heat.
Sauté half of meatballs until just cooked through, ~{8%minutes}.
Transfer to baking sheet in oven.
Repeat with remaining meatballs, adding oil to skillet if dry.
Reserve skillet.

= Muhammara =
Add @roasted red peppers{1/2%cup}(in jar, drained and chopped) to reserved skillet; stir 1 minute.
Add @water{1/2%cup} and @pomegranate molasses{2%tbsp}.
Bring to simmer, scraping up browned bits.
Cook until reduced to 2/3 cup, stirring occasionally, about ~{4%minutes}.

Mix in @Italian parsley{2%tbsp}(chopped).
Season to taste with @salt, @pepper, and more pomegranate molasses, if desired.
Transfer to small bowl.

= Serving =
Arrange onions and meatballs on platter.
Serve with warm breads, yogurt sauce, and muhammara.

